Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:09.53,Chinese,C05-13-S01,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,910)}累计费用要逐笔记实际发生的维护、登船支付、\N期间收入和其他支付，并使用一致日期范围对账。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:09.53,English,C05-13-S01,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1008)}Accumulated costs need actual records of maintenance,\Nembarkation payments, income, and other payments over the same dates.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.16,0:00:14.46,Chinese,C05-13-S02,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}钱包变少多少，是混合这些来源的净现金变化；
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.16,0:00:14.46,English,C05-13-S02,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1030)}A treasury decrease is a net gold change combining those sources.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.93,0:00:18.33,Chinese,C05-13-S03,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}地图上“会支付登船费”只是当时提示。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.93,0:00:18.33,English,C05-13-S03,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1030)}The map's embarkation warning is only the prediction at that moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.93,0:00:24.40,Chinese,C05-13-S04,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}没读到实际付款，就留空，不能把余额差改名为纯行军费。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.93,0:00:24.40,English,C05-13-S04,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1008)}Without an actual payment reading, leave the field empty.\NDo not rename the treasury difference “marching costs.”
